\\frac{2d\\cdot \\cancel{(d-3)}}{\\cancel{d-3}} \\\\ 4(d-3)+6 & =2d\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSolving this equation for $d,$ we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4(d-3)+6 & =2d \\\\ 4d-6 & =2d \\\\ 2d & =6 \\\\ d & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHowever, since $d=3$  is not a valid solution, our equation has no solutions." 13194139533887 true] [17592186263445 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263446 13194139533887 true] [17592186263445 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263447 13194139533887 true] [17592186263445 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263448 13194139533887 true] [17592186263445 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263449 13194139533887 true] [17592186263445 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263450 13194139533887 true] [17592186263445 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533887 true] [17592186263445 1041 "selection" 13194139533887 true] [17592186263445 1104 #edb/ref 17592186263447 13194139533887 true] [17592186263445 1110 #uuid "729cd202-ba72-5c62-87e7-7741f2063259" 13194139533887 true] [17592186263446 1034 "d=5" 13194139533887 true] [17592186263446 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533887 true] [17592186263446 1111 #uuid "c970dcde-364f-57f9-b7a0-4d8ff3d2d748" 13194139533887 true] [17592186263447 1034 "No solutions" 13194139533887 true] [17592186263447 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533887 true] [17592186263447 1111 #uuid "b8c36966-7cf7-5243-818f-b2f529af8923" 13194139533887 true] [17592186263448 1034 "d=\\frac{3}{2}" 13194139533887 true] [17592186263448 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533887 true] [17592186263448 1111 #uuid "933848bf-ee90-5eff-9012-588db264987d" 13194139533887 true] [17592186263449 1034 "d=4" 13194139533887 true] [17592186263449 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533887 true] [17592186263449 1111 #uuid "d6156905-92d6-5588-bbb0-d0047f992f52" 13194139533887 true] [17592186263450 1034 "d=-2" 13194139533887 true] [17592186263450 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533887 true] [17592186263450 1111 #uuid "1dd33a56-131d-5cd1-ad6b-38addad54961" 13194139533887 true] [17592186263451 1017 #edb/ref