{x(x+2)} \\\\ \\frac{2x(x+2)}{x}-\\frac{x(x+2)}{x+2} & =\\frac{4x(x+2)}{x(x+2)} \\\\ \\frac{2\\cancel{x}\\cdot (x+2)}{\\cancel{x}}-\\frac{x\\cdot \\cancel{(x+2)}}{\\cancel{x+2}} & =\\frac{4\\cdot \\cancel{x(x+2)}}{\\cancel{x(x+2)}} \\\\ 2(x+2)-x & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSolving this equation for $x,$ we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(x+2)-x & =4 \\\\ 2x+4-x & =4 \\\\ x & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHowever, since $x=0$ is not a valid solution, our equation has no solutions." 13194139533887 true] [17592186263496 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263497 13194139533887 true] [17592186263496 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263498 13194139533887 true] [17592186263496 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263499 13194139533887 true] [17592186263496 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263500 13194139533887 true] [17592186263496 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263501 13194139533887 true] [17592186263496 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533887 true] [17592186263496 1041 "selection" 13194139533887 true] [17592186263496 1104 #edb/ref 17592186263500 13194139533887 true] [17592186263496 1110 #uuid "4847b6ee-4a64-5ac9-9971-666494c84661" 13194139533887 true] [17592186263497 1034 "x=1" 13194139533887 true] [17592186263497 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533887 true] [17592186263497 1111 #uuid "7caf21fb-c93a-5863-b6b5-6afc57e2a074" 13194139533887 true] [17592186263498 1034 "x=3" 13194139533887 true] [17592186263498 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533887 true] [17592186263498 1111 #uuid "ec634806-4adb-5360-8110-ad5c92a2caa1" 13194139533887 true] [17592186263499 1034 "x=-3" 13194139533887 true] [17592186263499 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533887 true] [17592186263499 1111 #uuid "26322217-e385-59d6-b13d-c7549234daec" 13194139533887 true] [17592186263500 1034 "No solutions" 13194139533887 true] [17592186263500 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533887 true] [17592186263500 1111 #uuid "c793fbb8-4d50-5ac8-a792-58fbd6e33b75" 13194139533887 true] [17592186263501 1034 "x=2" 13194139533887 true] [17592186263501 1103 #ed